 "La app toca dos acordes finales (V–I o IV–I) en una tonalidad al azar; el alumno elige.": "The app plays two final chords (V–I or IV–I) in a random key; the student chooses.",
 "Perfecta, plagal, semicadencia o rota": "Perfect, plagal, half cadence, or deceptive cadence",
 "La app toca el final de una frase de cuatro acordes; el alumno elige la cadencia.": "The app plays the end of a four-chord phrase; the student chooses the cadence.",
 "Dictado de acordes": "Chord dictation",
