 "Tres negras con puntillo (cuatro pulsos y medio de negra) + una = seis pulsos de negra = cuatro pulsos de tres corcheas.": "Three dotted quarter notes (four and a half quarter-note beats) + one more = six quarter-note beats = four beats of three eighth notes.",
